From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 15:58:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add minute forecast (forecast/minutes:lookup) support

Adds MinuteForecastResponse and PrecipitationSegment models (per
google.maps.weather.v1 protos) and GoogleWeatherApi.async_get_minute_forecast.
The minutes endpoint has language_code reserved, so the client omits it there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CJh8vCGeayU99A1RYNYGD1
